ot wait to share them with you!-Karnage Studios","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T09:33:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382960-1844751498217825","game_id":"steam-4382960","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update","summary":"The Master has cooked up a massive update to the demo!General ChangesNew curses.New status effects:BleedingBurningPoisonNew enemy - Dragon Whelp.A ton of new character cosmetic options.Special rooms now appear in Purgatory to help you - Make sure you explore!New end of round stats with a brand new UI.Many many many other small refinements.You can now reset and continue after a failed run without going back to the main menu - Sorry about that :')Bug FixesI would love to list all the bugs we fixed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T09:02:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217825","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382960-1842212951310345","game_id":"steam-4382960","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.3458","summary":"Thanks so much to everyone that has tried the demo so far and given feedback! We have just shipped an update with a few tweaks and fixes.General ChangesThe firebreathing imps now deal damage over time instead of 1-shot damage.Leaderboard now shows 50 entries.Players can now hear each other while dead with in-game voice.Arcane Explosion has been significantly nerfed.Reduced the severity of the low health visual effect.Many items have had their cost and cooldowns balanced.Bug FixesFixed a bug that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T14:15:32Z","time_precision":"min